{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118043","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118043/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118043/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118043/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118043","id":4181478830,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7PCNez","number":118043,"title":"Security: Add bounds checks to prevent integer underflow in packet size validation","user":{"login":"warsang","id":9167018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNjcwMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9167018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang","html_url":"https://github.com/warsang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4332209698,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAjhGIg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:multiplayer","name":"topic:multiplayer","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-03-31T18:41:46Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T11:25:02Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T09:57:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118043","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118043","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118043.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118043.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\n\nThe `on_spawn_receive`, `on_delta_receive`, and `on_sync_receive` functions perform unsigned arithmetic (`p_buffer_len - ofs`) that can underflow if `ofs` exceeds `p_buffer_len`. A malicious client can craft packets that bypass size validation, leading to out-of-bounds memory access.\n\n## Issue Validation\n\nIssue validated via code inspection.\n\n## Impact\n\nA malicious client can send malformed spawn/sync/delta packets that bypass validation checks, potentially causing:\n- Out-of-bounds memory reads\n- Server crash (DoS)\n- Potential information disclosure\n\n## Reproduction\n\n1. Client connects to Godot multiplayer server\n2. Client sends spawn/sync/delta packet with `p_buffer_len` smaller than expected `ofs` offset\n3. Arithmetic `p_buffer_len - ofs` underflows to ~4 billion\n4. Size checks pass when they should not\n5. Subsequent buffer access reads out of bounds\n\n## Fix\n\nAdded explicit bounds checks (`ofs > p_buffer_len || ...`) before each unsigned subtraction to ensure the offset never exceeds the buffer length before performing safe arithmetic.\n\n## Files Changed\n\n- `modules/multiplayer/scene_replication_interface.cpp`","closed_by":{"login":"warsang","id":9167018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNjcwMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9167018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang","html_url":"https://github.com/warsang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118043/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118043/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}